#: assets/js/app.js:25931
msgid "Everything Minimal writes is native WordPress: real block markup, core options, core users. Deactivate the plugin and nothing is lost. Plugins extend Minimal with one PHP filter, as plain data, which is why nothing here can nag you."
msgstr "Minimal 寫入的所有內容均為 WordPress 原生資料：真正的區塊標記、核心選項及核心使用者。停用外掛不會遺失任何內容。外掛僅透過一個 PHP 篩選器，以純資料擴充 Minimal，因此這裡不會出現干擾通知。"

#: assets/js/app.js:25930
msgid " and hand your AI agent a revocable credential to do the fiddly work over the REST API."
msgstr "，並向你的 AI 代理提供可撤銷的憑證，以便透過 REST API 完成繁瑣工作。"

#: assets/js/app.js:25930
msgid "Your profile → AI Access"
msgstr "你的個人資料 → AI 存取權"

#: assets/js/app.js:25930
msgid "Minimal surfaces the settings people change day to day; the long tail stays in wp-admin on purpose. For plugin configuration Minimal doesn't rebuild, open"
msgstr "Minimal 顯示人們日常修改的設定；其他低頻設定則刻意保留在 wp-admin 中。若 Minimal 未重新建構某項外掛設定，請開啟"

#: assets/js/app.js:25929
msgid "Deliberately minimal"
msgstr "刻意保持簡潔"

#: assets/js/app.js:25911
msgid "Anything a plugin adds here can be hidden for you alone: right-click its sidebar entry or block-library heading and choose Hide. Everything hidden is listed on Your profile, where one click restores it."
msgstr "外掛在這裡新增的任何內容都可以只對你隱藏：在側邊欄項目或區塊庫標題上按一下滑鼠右鍵，然後選擇「隱藏」。所有隱藏內容都會列在「你的個人資料」中，按一下即可還原。"

#: assets/js/app.js:25910
msgid "Make it yours"
msgstr "打造你的專屬體驗"

#: assets/js/app.js:25908
msgid "The least discoverable thing in Minimal, so here it is in writing: rows in Content and Media, comments, the theme button, plugin entries in the sidebar and group headings in the block library all have right-click menus. When in doubt, try a right-click."
msgstr "這是 Minimal 中最不容易發現的功能，因此特別寫在這裡：「內容」和「媒體」中的資料列、留言、佈景主題按鈕、側邊欄中的外掛項目，以及區塊庫中的群組標題都有滑鼠右鍵選單。不確定時，就按一下滑鼠右鍵。"

#: assets/js/app.js:25907
msgid "Right-click almost anything"
msgstr "幾乎所有內容都能按一下滑鼠右鍵"

#: assets/js/app.js:25905
msgid ", then start typing a view, a post or a command."
msgstr "，然後開始輸入檢視、文章或命令。"

#: assets/js/app.js:25905
msgid "The sidebar has three groups: Workspace (the daily material), Tools (what your plugins add) and Manage (the site itself). The fastest way anywhere is the command palette:"
msgstr "側邊欄分為三組：工作區（日常內容）、工具（外掛新增的功能）和管理（網站本身）。前往任何位置最快的方法是使用命令面板："

#: assets/js/app.js:25904
msgid "Getting around"
msgstr "導覽方式"

#: assets/js/app.js:25902
msgid "A calm, fast surface for the work you do every day: writing, moderating, uploading, and keeping an eye on the site. Classic wp-admin stays fully available, one click away."
msgstr "這是一個安靜、快速的日常工作介面，可用於寫作、審核、上傳和掌握網站狀況。傳統 wp-admin 仍可完整使用，按一下即可開啟。"

#: assets/js/app.js:25902
msgid "Minimal is a reimagined WordPress admin."
msgstr "Minimal 是重新構想的 WordPress 管理後台。"

